<!DOCTYPE html>
<html metal:use-macro="context/@@pfas-macros/macros/page"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
      xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
      xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal">
<head>
  <title metal:fill-slot="title">System Map</title>
  <tal:styles metal:fill-slot="head-extra">
  <style>
    .map-intro { color: var(--s-secondary); font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 900px; }
    .map-wrap {
      border: 1px solid var(--s-border); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--s-bg);
      padding: 14px 8px; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .pfas-map-svg { display: block; min-width: 900px; }
    /* clickable bubbles */
    .pfas-map-svg a { text-decoration: none; }
    .pfas-map-svg .clickable { cursor: pointer; }
    .pfas-map-svg .clickable rect { transition: stroke-width .1s, filter .1s; }
    .pfas-map-svg a:hover .clickable rect {
      stroke-width: 3.4; filter: brightness(0.96) drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.18));
    }
    .pfas-map-svg a:focus { outline: none; }
    .pfas-map-svg a:focus .clickable rect { stroke-width: 3.4; }
    .map-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px 26px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--s-secondary); }
    .map-legend .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
    .map-legend .sw { width: 26px; height: 13px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid #adb5bd; display: inline-block; }
    .map-hint { font-size: 12px; color: var(--s-secondary); margin-top: 6px; }
  </style>
  </tal:styles>
</head>
<body>
  <tal:t metal:fill-slot="header-title">System Map</tal:t>

  <div metal:fill-slot="content">
  <div class="page-body" style="max-width:1180px;">

    <p class="map-intro">
      A live map of how each role’s workspace connects through the add-on to core
      SENAITE and out to the sample report. <strong>Click any highlighted bubble</strong>
      to jump straight to that screen to make an edit.
    </p>

    <div class="map-wrap" tal:content="structure view/map_svg">SVG</div>

    <div class="map-legend">
      <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:#e8f0fe;border-color:#3b6fb0"></span>User entry point (role workspace)</span>
      <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:#cbe6d3;border-color:#2e7d32"></span>★ Single-source master data</span>
      <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:#d7ecf3;border-color:#387493"></span>Add-on module / store</span>
      <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:#fff8e1;border-color:#c9a227"></span>★ spec_sync bridge to core</span>
      <span class="chip"><span class="sw" style="background:#eceff1;border-color:#607d8b"></span>Core SENAITE service</span>
    </div>
    <p class="map-hint">
      Edges: <span style="color:#3b6fb0;font-weight:600;">blue</span> entry → add-on ·
      <span style="color:#387493;font-weight:600;">teal</span> add-on → core ·
      <span style="color:#c9a227;font-weight:600;">amber ◂▸ two-way</span> live sync — edit the
      Method Profile <em>or</em> the AnalysisSpec and both update (per-analyte) ·
      dashed = single-source reference.
    </p>

  </div>
  </div><!-- /content slot -->
</body>
</html>
